mirror it was adapted from (hostname and repo path), plus an internal
engineer's first name. Neither belongs in a public repository. The comment is
reworded to keep the useful provenance note (this file derives from CVA6's
corev_apu/clint/axi_lite_interface.sv) without the internal hostname or the
personal attribution.

